<p>&nbsp;<br />
<em>The line of CRANE Hardware Universal Hard/Soft (UHS) gives you the durability and protection of a heavy flight case with the light weight of a gear bag. The multiple sizes and configurations allows for many different models of equipment to be stored safely. The quality found with these cases is second-to-none and the stylish design will turn heads in the store and on the road.</em><br />
<em>Fits Pioneer &gt; Native Instruments / Traktor &gt; Reloop &gt; Denon &gt; Numark &gt; AKAI Vestax &gt; Novation &gt; Allen &amp; Heath &gt; Hercules &gt; M-Audio &gt; Apple Technics &gt; Roland &gt; Stanton &gt; Ortofon &gt; Garmin &gt; Rane/Serato &gt; UREI American Audio &gt; Various &gt; Accessory &gt; Laptops</em></p>
